                                        </table><!-- END SPACER --><table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%" class="collapse" style="">
                                          <tbody>
                                            <tr>
                                              <th class="pad-top-24 small-12 columns" valign="top">
                                                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%" class="collapse no-mobile-border" style="border-left:3px solid #00C7FD;border-bottom:3px solid #00C7FD;">
                                                  <tbody><tr>
                                                  <th align="left" class="small-12 columns" style="padding:0 32px;width:290px" valign="top"><img src="https://intel.file.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153b000005vLj1&oid=00Do0000000aRcf&lastMod=1687177298000" alt="" style="display:block;height:54px;width:174px;" height="54" valign="top" width="174"><h1 style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;mso-hyphenate:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:25px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:32px;margin:0;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">지금 바로&nbsp;시작</h1>
                                                      <table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                                                        <tbody>
                                                          <tr>
                                                            <th style="padding-bottom:24px;"><!-- START BUTTON --><table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="auto">
                                                                <tbody>
                                                                  <tr>
                                                                  <td style="background-color:#00C7FD;padding:10px 24px 10px 24px;"><a href="{{EVLINK}}" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;mso-hyphenate:none;color:#262626;display:block;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">클릭하여 가입&sup1;&rarr;</a></td>
                                                                  </tr>
                                                                </tbody>
                                                              </table><!-- END BUTTON --></th>
                                                          </tr>
                                                        </tbody>
                                                      </table>
                                                      <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:16px;margin:0;margin-bottom:24px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">&sup1;이메일 주소를 입력한 후 '계정 만들기'를 선택하는 게 아니라 '계속'을 선택하십시오.</p> 
                                                    </th>
                                                  </tr>
                                                </tbody></table>
  
  
                                              </th>
                                            <th class="pad-top-24 small-12 columns" style="width:300px;"><img src="https://intel.file.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153b000005vLiw&oid=00Do0000000aRcf&lastMod=1687177231000" alt="" class="responsive" style="display:block;height:300px;vertical-align:bottom;width:300px;" height="300" valign="bottom" width="300"> <!-- START SPACER --><table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="show-for-small" style="display:none;mso-hide:all" width="100%">
                                                  <tbody>
                                                    <tr>
                                                      <th align="center" style="font-size:16px;line-height:16px;width:100%" height="16">
                                                        &nbsp;
                                                      </th>
                                                    </tr>
                                                  </tbody>
                                                </table><!-- END SPACER --></th>
                                            </tr>
                                          </tbody>
                                        </table>
                                      </th>
                                    </tr>
                                  </tbody>
                                </table>
                              </th>
  
                            </tr>
                          </tbody>
                        </table><!-- END HEADER --> <!-- START LEFT ALIGNED CONTENT --><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                          <tbody>
                            <tr>
                              <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-top:48px;width:510px;">
                                <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">수신자: {!Contact.LastName}{!Contact.FirstName} ({!Contact.Email}):<br><span style="font-size:14px">참고: 이메일 주소가 사용자 이름입니다.</span><br><br>인&#xfeff;텔&#xfeff;&reg; 파트너 얼라이언스에 가입하면 다음에 즉시 액세스하여 고급 교육, 개발자 리소스, 마케팅 및 판매 도구, 지원을 이용할 수 있습니다.</p>
                                <ul style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:32px;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">
                                  <li style="margin-bottom:16px;">기술, 전략 및 모범 사례를 통해 비즈니스를 혁신하는 인&#xfeff;텔&#xfeff;&reg;의 리더십 사고와 업계 전문가</li>
                                  <li style="margin-bottom:16px;">전문 지식을 선보이기 위한 모든 수준의 영업 및 기술 교육</li>
                                  <li style="margin-bottom:16px;">기술 리더와의 정기 웨비나 및 인&#xfeff;텔&#xfeff;&reg; 솔루션 아키텍트와의 기술 강연</li>
                                  <li style="margin-bottom:16px;">혁신, 비즈니스, 기술 기회에 중점을 둔 토론에 참여할 수 있는 포럼</li>
                                  <li style="margin-bottom:16px;">생태계 파트너 및 클라우드 시스템 아키텍트의 강력한 네트워크에 액세스</li>                                  
                              </ul> 
                              <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">성장하는 파트너 생태계의 일부가&nbsp;되십시오.<br><br>잠깐 시간을 내어 등록을 완료하면 오늘 바로 시작할 수 있습니다.</p>                               
                                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                                    <tbody><tr>
                                        <th style="min-width:200px;"><!-- START BUTTON --><table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="auto">
                                            <tbody>
                                                <tr>
                                              <td style="background-color:#00C7FD;padding:10px 24px 10px 24px;"><a href="{{EVLINK}}" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;mso-hyphenate:none;color:#262626;display:block;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">클릭하여 가입&sup1;&rarr; </a></td>
                                                </tr>
                                            </tbody>
                                            </table><!-- END BUTTON --></th>
                                    </tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                            <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:16px;margin:0;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">&sup1;이메일 주소를 입력한 후 '계정 만들기'를 선택하는 게 아니라 '계속'을 선택하십시오.</p> 
                              </th>
                            </tr>
                          </tbody>
                        </table><!-- END LEFT ALIGNED CONTENT --> <!-- START POINTS INFO --><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                          <tbody><tr>
                            <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;padding-bottom:48px;">
                              <table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                                <tbody>
                                  <tr>
                                    <th class="small-12 columns" style="background-color:#0054AE;padding:32px;">
                                        
                                        <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">인텔의 새로운 로그인 프로세스에 관해 알아보려면 <a href="https://www.intel.co.kr/content/www/kr/ko/support/topics/azure-sign-in.html" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:underline;">여기</a>를 클릭하십시오.</p>
  
                                      <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-top:32px;padding:0;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">파트너 가입에 도움이 필요하십니까?<br><a href="https://supporttickets.intel.com/s/supportrequest?language=en_US" target="_blank" style="color:#fff;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;"><span style="text-decoration:underline;">지원팀 연락처</span></a></p>
                                    </th>
                                  </tr>
                                </tbody>
                              </table>
                            </th>
                          </tr>
                        </tbody></table><!-- END POINTS INFO --> <!-- START SIGNOFF BLADE - UPDATE THE BACKGROUND COLOR ON THE BLADE BY CHANGING THIS TABLE BACKGROUND --><table role="presentation" align="center" style="background-color:#0054AE;" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                          <tbody>
                            <tr>
                              <th>
                            
                              <center><img align="middle" alt="연결. 혁신. 성장." class="responsive" height="80" src="https://intel.file.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153b000005vLiX&oid=00Do0000000aRcf&lastMod=1687176760000" style="-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;display:block;outline:0;width:670px;height:80px;" width="670"></center>
                              </th>
                            </tr>
                          </tbody>
                        </table><!-- END SIGNOFF BLADE --></th>
                    </tr>
  
                  </tbody>
                </table>
  
              </center>
            </th>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <table role="presentation" bgcolor="#efefef" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="body" valign="top" width="100%">
